WEBVTT

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.470
Zola!

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:10.600
THE FINAL BATTLE

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:22.766
- Zola!
- Zola!

00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:27.326
Zola!

00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:28.733
Are you all right?!

00:02:28.933 --> 00:02:29.603
Zola!

00:02:31.266 --> 00:02:32.726
Maro!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.000
She's still breathing!

00:02:37.933 --> 00:02:38.933
Nene...

00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:40.226
You!

00:02:41.766 --> 00:02:43.766
This isn't a child's game.

00:02:44.166 --> 00:02:46.396
You have no right to reproach me.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.366
No right! No right!

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:56.970
I wonder what you can
do without Zola.

00:02:57.266 --> 00:02:58.966
I wonder, I wonder!

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:04.973
Conquer!

00:03:08.733 --> 00:03:10.533
Crushing Nail!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:29.200
Just what one would expect from
descendents of Soldiers of Light...

00:03:29.866 --> 00:03:31.426
But I'll tell you something...

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.470
You guys aren't the only
descendents of Soldiers of Light.

00:03:37.366 --> 00:03:42.296
And you made me angry!

00:03:46.733 --> 00:03:47.733
The Shadows!

00:03:56.666 --> 00:03:57.966
What is that?!

00:03:58.233 --> 00:03:59.973
It appears he's grown humongous.

00:04:06.266 --> 00:04:07.596
H-He's huge...

00:04:07.866 --> 00:04:10.526
Is that his true form?

00:04:10.866 --> 00:04:12.126
Maro...

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:13.200
Calm down!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:20.230
His form may have changed,
but it's still Nene we're fighting!

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.370
So stay calm, everybody!

00:04:22.966 --> 00:04:25.996
We can take him down
if we all work together!

00:04:32.633 --> 00:04:35.073
Now, we have to take him down!

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:36.833
Kluke...

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.170
Shu and Jiro,
attack him from a distance.

00:04:39.366 --> 00:04:40.896
Bouquet, you back them up.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.500
How?

00:04:42.766 --> 00:04:45.896
Nene knows about
your new ability.

00:04:46.366 --> 00:04:48.526
So use that to our advantage
to put a brake on him!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.800
Uh, uhhh, right!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:51.870
Maruamaro!

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.170
Maro!

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.600
Stir things up using
Saber Tiger's speed.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:58.130
But avoid his attacks, okay?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.600
Got it, maro!

00:05:01.766 --> 00:05:04.226
We'll back up Marumaro!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:05.800
Understood!

00:05:06.133 --> 00:05:07.233
Those orders are right on target!

00:05:07.366 --> 00:05:08.026
Huh?

00:05:08.466 --> 00:05:10.496
With Zola out of commission,

00:05:10.533 --> 00:05:13.603
I'm glad there's someone who
can think tactics in perspective.

00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:19.473
Kluke must have given a lot of
thought to how we can win this battle.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:20.870
Yeah!

00:05:21.633 --> 00:05:24.303
General Logi,
the troops have been deployed.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.530
What about you,
Schneider and Andropov?

00:05:28.933 --> 00:05:31.203
We were ready ages ago.

00:05:31.733 --> 00:05:34.503
The only thing we need
are your orders, General Logi.

00:05:35.466 --> 00:05:39.096
I see... All hands,
stand by in your current positions.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.230
Wait for my orders to commence.

00:05:43.433 --> 00:05:44.103
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:05:48.533 --> 00:05:50.033
Maro!

00:05:50.066 --> 00:05:52.526
Take our Iron Justice!

00:05:55.866 --> 00:05:57.596
Feather Protect!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:06.530
Fire Crisis!

00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:11.666
Conquer!

00:06:14.866 --> 00:06:16.396
It's not working at all?!

00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:17.666
Impossible!

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:20.473
Poor children...

00:06:21.033 --> 00:06:23.133
My Shadow's name is Chimera...

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.000
If you knew the meaning
of that word,

00:06:27.033 --> 00:06:31.933
I wonder if you'd still be able to
come at me like that...

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.670
You are truly pitiful!

00:06:35.166 --> 00:06:36.966
Pitiful! Pitiful!

00:06:38.533 --> 00:06:41.333
Blitz Claw!

00:06:45.033 --> 00:06:46.173
Maro!

00:06:46.266 --> 00:06:47.866
I'll start with this one!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.330
Marumaro, pull back!

00:06:51.566 --> 00:06:52.226
Maro!

00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:53.726
Shu! Jiro!

00:06:54.033 --> 00:06:55.433
Fire Crisis!

00:06:56.033 --> 00:06:57.033
Conquer!

00:07:00.866 --> 00:07:02.166
Why isn't it working?

00:07:07.166 --> 00:07:08.296
What's so funny?!

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:11.130
You don't understand why?!

00:07:11.933 --> 00:07:13.733
Then I'll tell you...

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:19.830
Your attacks have absolutely
no effect on my Chimera.

00:07:20.366 --> 00:07:21.366
You're bluffing!

00:07:21.566 --> 00:07:25.766
That girl over there knows very well
whether I'm bluffing or not.

00:07:27.066 --> 00:07:28.066
Kluke...

00:07:28.566 --> 00:07:29.796
That's not true...

00:07:31.466 --> 00:07:33.726
I may not know how
to defeat you just yet.

00:07:34.366 --> 00:07:36.166
But I can say this for certain...

00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:38.703
We will never give up!

00:07:39.333 --> 00:07:43.703
If we do, then this world
will be ruled by you!

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:44.570
Kluke!

00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:46.873
We'll keep trying
no matter what it takes.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.496
Because we're here
to take you down!

00:07:50.866 --> 00:07:54.626
I'm a defender of justice, maro!
I'll defeat you, maro!

00:07:55.233 --> 00:07:57.233
Spread out and attack!

00:07:57.966 --> 00:07:59.666
Mix it up more this time

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:02.930
so he doesn't know where
the next attack is coming from!

00:08:03.033 --> 00:08:04.033
- Got it!
- Got it!

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:10.730
Oh no, I'm not that nice, you know.
This time I'll take the initiative.

00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:14.873
Let me hear you scream!

00:08:14.966 --> 00:08:15.966
He's fast!

00:08:17.766 --> 00:08:19.226
Maro!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.170
I won't let you!

00:08:23.233 --> 00:08:24.233
Bouquet!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.000
Yikes! Boss Lady!

00:08:28.033 --> 00:08:29.903
Hippo, we just need to
hang in there!

00:08:30.766 --> 00:08:32.796
I just have to avoid
hitting the Shadow, right?

00:08:38.633 --> 00:08:39.633
Bouquet!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.200
Let me hear it!

00:08:41.433 --> 00:08:43.173
Your pain!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.670
Let me hear it! Your despair!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.870
Dark Symphony!

00:08:57.733 --> 00:08:59.103
Maro!

00:08:59.833 --> 00:09:01.403
Zola! Bouquet!

00:09:04.933 --> 00:09:06.703
Do you understand now?

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:09.430
It doesn't matter how much
stronger you've become,

00:09:09.466 --> 00:09:13.166
because I hold even
greater power than that.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.370
I've thoroughly researched
my descendant power,

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:23.700
and enhanced it
till its absolute limit!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.600
And I am able to manipulate
that power on command...

00:09:28.433 --> 00:09:33.373
I have become an even more
powerful entity than the Darkness

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:37.500
that the seven Soldiers of Light
barely managed to seal away.

00:09:37.733 --> 00:09:38.933
Do you understand?

00:09:39.366 --> 00:09:42.666
You guys don't even have
the slightest chance of winning.

00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.603
Because there're only six of you...

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:54.000
And I'm the last descendant
with this enormous power!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.400
I will become the ruler of this world!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:04.570
Now that I have this legendary power,
I shall become its new god!

00:10:11.233 --> 00:10:13.373
More... Give me more...

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.500
Let me hear
your screams of despair!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:24.200
Your pain! Your helplessness!
Your hatred! Give it all to me!

00:10:26.366 --> 00:10:27.896
Maro...

00:10:30.233 --> 00:10:32.133
You...jerk!

00:10:32.533 --> 00:10:33.833
More!

00:10:36.566 --> 00:10:37.566
Shu!

00:10:39.733 --> 00:10:41.473
Blue Explosion!

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.930
Shu!

00:11:12.266 --> 00:11:12.926
Shu...

00:11:13.266 --> 00:11:14.296
Hey, Shu!

00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:19.433
Mister!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.900
Why are you standing there
all spaced out like that?

00:11:22.666 --> 00:11:24.426
Uh, umm...

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:25.930
It's over, right?

00:11:28.466 --> 00:11:29.596
You must be tired.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.030
You should get some rest first.

00:11:33.133 --> 00:11:35.773
Uh, yeah... Where's everybody?

00:11:35.933 --> 00:11:38.733
Everybody? Who's "everybody"?

00:11:39.066 --> 00:11:40.126
Zola and Jiro...

00:11:40.433 --> 00:11:42.773
Kluke, Bouquet, and Marumaro...

00:11:43.066 --> 00:11:44.326
Don't worry.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.700
They'll be here before long.

00:12:11.933 --> 00:12:12.603
Everybody...

00:12:14.033 --> 00:12:16.573
What is this?
Something's wrong...

00:12:17.366 --> 00:12:19.626
What the hell is happening?!

00:12:25.833 --> 00:12:27.373
Hey! Blue Dragon!

00:12:27.966 --> 00:12:33.166
Blue Dragon! Tell me!
What the hell is happening?! Hey!

00:12:44.166 --> 00:12:47.896
You don't need me anymore...

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.200
Blue Dragon!

00:12:56.666 --> 00:13:00.066
You've decided not to
fight anymore, right?

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.000
Who decided?!

00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:05.030
Shu, you don't get it, do you?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.570
You decided that yourself.

00:13:08.966 --> 00:13:10.026
What?!

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.400
Now that you've decided
to stop fighting,

00:13:13.033 --> 00:13:15.173
we can't be together.

00:13:16.866 --> 00:13:18.496
So long, Shu!

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.270
Sonic Scissors!

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:36.470
Waves of Rage!

00:13:40.933 --> 00:13:42.333
How about that, maro!

00:13:44.066 --> 00:13:45.466
This is nothing...

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.330
It's not working, maro?

00:13:51.966 --> 00:13:53.196
Maro!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:54.700
Marumaro!

00:13:59.466 --> 00:14:01.266
Feather Protect!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:05.670
If you really think you
can bounce off my power,

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:07.870
then go ahead and try!

00:14:13.966 --> 00:14:14.626
Kluke?!

00:14:15.466 --> 00:14:16.126
Jiro...

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.000
His forehead...

00:14:19.233 --> 00:14:22.103
Forehead? What?!
What does that mean?!

00:14:22.866 --> 00:14:25.026
With Shu...

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.070
Kluke!

00:14:30.333 --> 00:14:31.673
Nene!

00:14:33.233 --> 00:14:35.303
Sky Terror!

00:14:36.900 --> 00:14:37.570
What's that?!

00:14:50.533 --> 00:14:54.203
This is too brutal!
That guy is invulnerable!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.230
Sh-Shu...

00:15:06.266 --> 00:15:08.626
Blue Dragon, wait!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:14.470
That's right...

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:16.870
I...

00:15:19.366 --> 00:15:20.496
was fighting!

00:15:21.666 --> 00:15:22.896
Blue Dragon!

00:15:24.766 --> 00:15:25.766
What's the matter?

00:15:26.033 --> 00:15:28.303
Is there something
you still wanna say?

00:15:28.866 --> 00:15:30.626
I can still fight!

00:15:31.533 --> 00:15:32.533
That's impossible.

00:15:33.033 --> 00:15:36.273
What can you do
with that battered body?

00:15:37.666 --> 00:15:39.366
It doesn't matter!

00:15:39.666 --> 00:15:42.166
I vowed to protect everyone!

00:15:42.833 --> 00:15:46.473
I vowed to stop the sadness
from spreading any further!

00:15:46.866 --> 00:15:49.326
That's why I will never give up!

00:15:49.833 --> 00:15:54.003
Blue Dragon!
Please fight together with me again!

00:15:57.466 --> 00:15:58.466
Let's fight!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.770
Shu!

00:16:22.933 --> 00:16:25.533
Blue Dragon has come back?!

00:16:26.166 --> 00:16:28.496
What do you plan to
do all by yourself?

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.270
Plan to do, plan to do!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.930
He's not alone!

00:16:34.900 --> 00:16:37.930
If I don't stand up now,
I'll regret it for the rest of my life!

00:16:38.833 --> 00:16:41.333
One who's about to die and
one who just nearly died...

00:16:41.466 --> 00:16:44.366
But what can the two of you do?

00:16:58.733 --> 00:17:01.533
Nene! It's not just the two of us!

00:17:02.466 --> 00:17:04.266
They may not be fighting
alongside right now...

00:17:05.033 --> 00:17:07.103
They may not be here
with us in body...

00:17:07.766 --> 00:17:10.326
But we are still fighting together!

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.570
What are you talking about?

00:17:12.833 --> 00:17:13.903
You don't get it?

00:17:14.133 --> 00:17:16.633
Everyone's thoughts...

00:17:19.700 --> 00:17:21.100
And their hearts...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.870
- We've been fighting while
- We've been fighting while

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:27.100
- carrying all of that all along!
- carrying all of that all along!

00:17:27.366 --> 00:17:31.896
Then I shall crush
all that along with you!

00:17:32.033 --> 00:17:33.273
Here goes!

00:17:33.666 --> 00:17:35.226
Fire Crisis!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:36.700
It's useless!

00:17:36.866 --> 00:17:38.096
Shu! His forehead!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.170
Target the light on his forehead!

00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:43.600
Conquer!

00:17:45.566 --> 00:17:46.566
What?!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:52.370
We did it!

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:53.700
Just as I thought!

00:17:54.366 --> 00:17:55.426
What do you mean?

00:17:56.266 --> 00:17:58.266
Look at the crystal on
Chimera's forehead.

00:17:59.133 --> 00:18:01.633
He used that to alter his elements.

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.000
Elements?

00:18:03.633 --> 00:18:07.473
Chimeras are artificially created
by mixing different animals.

00:18:08.366 --> 00:18:10.026
Nene utilized each characteristic.

00:18:10.233 --> 00:18:13.303
Chimera must've been changing his
base element to ward off our attacks,

00:18:13.333 --> 00:18:17.633
like using water against fire,
or earth against lightning.

00:18:18.933 --> 00:18:22.433
So if we attack using flames
and lightning simultaneously...

00:18:23.166 --> 00:18:25.166
He won't be able to deal with them.

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.630
That's right.

00:18:27.866 --> 00:18:29.366
You saved us, Kluke!

00:18:30.233 --> 00:18:32.203
Alright, let's keep going at him!

00:18:32.466 --> 00:18:33.466
I won't forgive this.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:39.870
You pesky children!
You hurt my Chimera.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.170
I can no longer allow you to live!

00:18:43.633 --> 00:18:45.933
I'm throwing those words
right back at you!

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:47.700
Let's take him down
in one swoop, Jiro!

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:51.430
I wonder if you can still
say that after seeing this...

00:18:52.133 --> 00:18:53.603
Release the Limiter!

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:55.300
Release! Release!

00:19:03.433 --> 00:19:04.433
That's?!

00:19:04.466 --> 00:19:06.596
The Chimera swallowed Nene...

00:19:11.566 --> 00:19:12.566
Hey, Shu!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.130
Don't get all scared!

00:19:15.433 --> 00:19:17.503
Have you already forgotten
your vow earlier?

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.670
Of course not!

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.330
I told you before!
Believe in our power!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.370
Got it!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.000
Shu, we'll finish him
with our next attack!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:28.500
Right!

00:19:28.766 --> 00:19:30.166
Die!

00:19:37.466 --> 00:19:38.826
Don't let your guard down!

00:19:39.166 --> 00:19:40.966
Tell that to Jiro, not me!

00:19:52.133 --> 00:19:53.703
Don't let your guard down!

00:19:55.066 --> 00:19:56.366
Go!

00:19:57.333 --> 00:19:58.433
They fell for it!

00:20:08.566 --> 00:20:09.566
This is the end!

00:20:17.733 --> 00:20:18.933
Thank you, Zola!

00:20:18.966 --> 00:20:19.966
It's useless!

00:20:22.566 --> 00:20:24.096
That doesn't look good!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Can't dodge that!

00:20:30.166 --> 00:20:31.166
Jiro!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.270
I'm leaving the rest to you, Shu...

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:40.130
Shu! Pour your heart
and soul into me!

00:20:40.633 --> 00:20:42.373
How persistent!

00:20:43.533 --> 00:20:45.673
Blue Explosion!

00:20:57.033 --> 00:20:58.033
It's futile!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:01.900
You cannot defeat me with
the power of Shadow anymore.

00:21:02.566 --> 00:21:04.066
Be gone!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:05.370
Everything, Shu!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.330
Hit him with everything we've got!

00:21:08.366 --> 00:21:09.366
Shu!

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.070
Shu!

00:21:11.433 --> 00:21:12.103
Shu!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.170
Shu!

00:21:15.766 --> 00:21:17.326
Shu!

00:21:17.933 --> 00:21:21.133
Go!

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.030
No... This can't be!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.970
- This is the end!
- This is the end!

00:21:30.233 --> 00:21:31.703
- Nene!
- Nene!

00:21:35.066 --> 00:21:39.466
This can't be... I'm almighty...

00:21:47.233 --> 00:21:48.233
The Galleon?!

00:21:50.566 --> 00:21:51.866
The Galleon has been silenced!

00:21:54.533 --> 00:21:56.703
All hands! Commence!

00:21:56.866 --> 00:21:58.466
What?! The Galleon is?

00:21:59.133 --> 00:22:00.673
Yes, there's no mistake!

00:22:01.266 --> 00:22:06.296
Send reinforcements immediately!
Move all available troops to Korin!

00:22:06.333 --> 00:22:08.873
Nope, that's not going to happen.

00:22:09.333 --> 00:22:10.333
Who are you?!

00:22:10.533 --> 00:22:13.933
From now on,
we'll be giving the orders.

00:22:14.233 --> 00:22:16.073
Is... Is this a coup?

00:22:16.333 --> 00:22:18.403
No, not really.

00:22:23.333 --> 00:22:26.233
This is the dawn of a new age.

00:22:26.766 --> 00:22:31.366
I hereby announce our secession
from the Grankingdom!

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:20.270
What awaited Shu and the others when
they retuned to the town of Logic,

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:22.870
were the smiling faces of people who had
gathered there from around the world.

00:24:22.900 --> 00:24:24.330
Now that we've taken Nene down,

00:24:24.366 --> 00:24:25.566
what kind of journey should
we head out to next?

00:24:25.600 --> 00:24:26.830
Our honeymoon!

00:24:26.866 --> 00:24:28.666
At least come up with something
we can all do together!

00:24:28.700 --> 00:24:30.530
Well, then how about finding
a husband for Kluke?

00:24:30.566 --> 00:24:32.426
I'll nominate myself, maro!

00:24:32.466 --> 00:24:33.466
No thank you!

00:24:33.566 --> 00:24:35.726
Next on Blue Dragon:
The Triumphant Return
